{"asset_key":"ep2/gameplay_story_12600060","episode":"ep2","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"12600060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1260006001:0":{"text":"설마 그 그레이브본 몬스터도...","source_cn":"这些亡灵怪物，该不会也……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64A31891FECD5586","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1260006002:0":{"text":"...보세요, 역시 변했네요!","source_cn":"——看，它们果然也变形了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA27685A1B433536","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1260006003:0":{"text":"치피의 비명 소리와 함께 몬스터의 몸이 뒤틀리더니 평범한 여성의 모습이 드러났다.","source_cn":"随着满满的惊呼，怪物的身形开始扭曲，露出了平凡女性的身影。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA0AE7E0C889F932","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1260006004:0":{"text":"그들은 몽롱해 보였지만, 잠시 시간이 지나자, 정신을 차린 듯했다...","source_cn":"她们看起来昏昏沉沉，过了片刻才终于恢复了些许精神……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED96933F60ECB171","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1260006005:0":{"text":"무슨 일이 일어난 거지... 우윽, 토할 것 같아...","source_cn":"发生了什么事……呜呃，有点想吐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E90E6692ECC3710","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1260006006:0":{"text":"눈앞 흐릿해. 몸은 또 왜 이렇게 욱신거리는 거지...","source_cn":"眼睛好花，身上怎么这么酸痛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EEFC4C614A3795F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1260006007:0":{"text":"조금 전에 아주 힘든 꿈을 꾼 것만 같아...","source_cn":"刚刚好像是做了个很累人的梦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x441C6E04E07B7805","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1260006008:1":{"text":"어? 소니아 님? 당신이 어떻게 여기에?!","source_cn":"咦，索尼娅女士？您怎么在这里？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0A1C753119BCC57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1260006009:0":{"text":"...너희 ...내 기억이 맞다면 너희는 부두 근처에서 돛을 담당하는 여자 노동자가 아닌가?","source_cn":"……你们……我没记错的话，你们是在码头附近专门负责船帆...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE94811CF242EA053","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1260006010:0":{"text":"몇 주 전, 여러 척의 배가 출항을 기다리고 있어서 그때 내가 너희에게 긴급 주문을 완성할 수 있겠냐고 물었던 기억이 나.","source_cn":"前两周好几艘船都等着出海，我记得那时我们见过面，问过你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B7D70C69ECA124B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1260006011:0":{"text":"맞아요. 제가 그때 협상을 했던 공장 책임자에요. 당시 저 둘도 자리에 있어서 작업 기간과 품질에 대해 평가하는 걸 도왔었죠.","source_cn":"对，我是负责的工长，那时是我和您谈判的，她俩当时也在，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01F947227FAB243E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1260006012:1":{"text":"보아하니 이들도 죄 없는 피해자인 것 같군.","source_cn":"看起来这几个人也是无辜的受害者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38785EE93C15EFF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1260006013:0":{"text":"이들도... 피해자? 조금 전 같은 상황이 일어났었나?","source_cn":"受害者……也？你们刚刚碰到了一样的情况？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B01EBE7EEA27C8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1260006014:1":{"text":"비슷합니다. 물귀신파가 쥐로 변했었습니다.","source_cn":"类似。之前那几个爱挑事的水鬼帮，他们被变成了老鼠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x102A3DC0C726F8DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1260006015:1":{"text":"쥐...?","source_cn":"老鼠……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3E055C94069F427","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1260006016:1":{"text":"네, 마침 조사 중이었고요.","source_cn":"我们正在调查。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3FC449ED093AF8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1260006017:1":{"text":"쥐로 변했다가, 그레이브본으로 변했다가... 일이 점점 더 복잡해지는군.","source_cn":"一会儿变成老鼠，一会儿变成亡灵……事情真是越来越复杂了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4C2D021F6BEEB11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1260006018:1":{"text":"다들, 조금 전 상황에 대해서는 내가 사람을 보내 제대로 조사할 테니, 너희들이 기억을 잃기 전 무언가 이상한 일은 없었는지 한 번 생각해 봐 주겠어?","source_cn":"各位，刚刚的情况我会安排人去调查清楚，你们在失去意识之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD87FDED87D7A006C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1260006019:0":{"text":"저희 셋은 오늘 추가 근무를 하러 가기로 했어요. 제가 가장 먼저 공장에 도착했지만 평소와 다른 점은 발견하지 못했고요.","source_cn":"我们三个约好今天去赶工加班，我先到了工厂，但没发现有什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06337700918AA115","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1260006020:1":{"text":"저, 전 뭔가 이상한 걸 본 것 같아요!","source_cn":"我、我好像看到了一些不寻常的东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2431037FA3AFD2BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1260006021:0":{"text":"딸아이를 친구에게 데려다 주느라 시간이 좀 지체되었길래 아르키아를 불러서 집을 나섰을 땐 이미 약속 시간보다 훨씬 늦은 시간이었어요.","source_cn":"我送女儿去找朋友玩，路上耽搁了一些，所以叫上阿奇雅一起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47B1C5119AB57562","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1260006022:1":{"text":"세린을 만나기 전, 저희는 지름길로 향했죠...","source_cn":"见到施琳之前，我们提着裙子，抄了一条近路……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1835545DA88ABFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1260006023:0":{"text":"...하, 이번엔 너희들로 가을의 수확의 흥을 돋워야겠어.","source_cn":"……呵，这次就选你们成为秋夜节的余兴吧 。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C391BFEC1EA99C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1260006024:0":{"text":"아르키아, 앞에 있는 저 여자 봤어?","source_cn":"阿奇雅，你看到前面那个女人了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7325DF03DB89F61D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1260006025:2":{"text":"왜 그래, 졸라? 저쪽엔 아무것도 없는데.","source_cn":"怎么了，卓菈。那边什么人都没有呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7109EA4AF729B559","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1260006026:0":{"text":"어라... 사라졌네? 내가 잘못 본 건가?","source_cn":"咦……消失了？是我看错了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6896D88052F81C82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1260006027:1":{"text":"...음, 왜 갑자기 머리가 어지러운 것 같지...","source_cn":"……唔，头怎么有点晕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6F43AE9C39187D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1260006028:0":{"text":"그리고는 갑자기 하늘이 빙글빙글 도는 것 같은 느낌이 들더니, 그다음엔 아무것도 기억이 나질 않아요.","source_cn":"紧接着，我突然感到一阵天旋地转，然后就什么都不知道了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA4A99505A029A34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1260006029:0":{"text":"그 사람은 줄곧 어두운 곳에 있어서 얼굴을 제대로 보지는 못했지만, 어째서인지 미인일 거라는 느낌이 들었어요.","source_cn":"那个人一直在暗处，我没看清她的相貌。不知为何，尽管没看...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97C8537F92E01550","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1260006030:1":{"text":"알겠어. 일단은 여기에 남아있도록 해. 의사를 보내 검사를 해달라고 할 테니.","source_cn":"我知道了。你们先不要离开，我派人请医师来给你们检查身体。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE5677C23EE551B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1260006031:1":{"text":"어제 그 그레이브본이 한 짓이 맞는 것 같네. 뭐라고 부르더라? 세시아?","source_cn":"这听起来就是昨天那个亡灵做的没错。你们管她叫什么，瑟西娅？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0A522B4CD1D6A57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1260006032:1":{"text":"전에 땅거미 숲에서 본 적이 있어요. 그때 그녀는 숲의 생명력을 추출하고 있었죠.","source_cn":"我们在薄暮丛林见过她，那个时候，她正在抽取丛林里的生命力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96D4742C06100417","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1260006033:1":{"text":"그러니까, 나쁜 녀석이라는 거네.","source_cn":"也就是说，是个坏蛋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x618942D0137E9BA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1260006034:0":{"text":"하지만 저희에겐 친절한 편이니, 단순히 나쁜 짓을 한다기보다는 어떤 목적을 달성하기 위해 움직이고 있는 것 같아요.","source_cn":"不过她对我们还算客气。比起单纯作恶，她更像是为了达成什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB366B2515E2680BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1260006035:1":{"text":"흥, 목적이라니... 그레이브본에게 무슨 목적이 있겠어?","source_cn":"哼，目的……亡灵还能有什么目的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6E6E4CAB7A0D152","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1260006036:1":{"text":"길 가던 사람을 아무렇지도 않게 그레이브본으로 바꾸다니, 이런 냉혹하고 잔인한 괴물이라면 또 어떤 소동을 일으킬지 몰라.","source_cn":"居然这么无所谓地随手把路人变化为亡灵，这种冷酷无情的怪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90A929F7E9419F91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:63:1260006037:1":{"text":"마치 소니아의 추측에 대답이라도 하듯, 골목 어귀에서 그림자 하나가 달려들었다.","source_cn":"仿佛回答索尼娅的推测一般，一个身影急匆匆地从街口冲了过来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AB74D3169964647","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1260006038:1":{"text":"브, 블러디 로즈, 당신네들 사람 좀 어떻게 해봐!","source_cn":"血、血薇帮的，管管你们弟兄！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48CFFF87C4A22D7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:68:1260006039:1":{"text":"누가 “와일드 베어”도 괴물이 된 걸 봤다더군!","source_cn":"有人看到“暴熊”他们也变成了怪物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C9DDCDA22F107C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1260006040:1":{"text":"...역시 그렇게 간단할 리가 없지.","source_cn":"……果然不会这么简单。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7999354871535162","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1260006041:1":{"text":"소란이 커지는 걸 막아야만 해. 어서 가자.","source_cn":"得去制止骚乱继续扩大。我们快走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DA83D5517E8C013","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"